{"number":86,"nameArabic":"الطارق","nameSimple":"At-Tariq","nameEnglish":"The Nightcommer","revelationPlace":"makkah","ayahCount":17,"bismillahPre":true,"ayahs":[{"n":1,"ar":"وَالسَّماءِ وَالطّارِقِ","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>طَّارِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>١</span>","en":"By the sky and the night comer -"},{"n":2,"ar":"وَما أَدرىٰكَ مَا الطّارِقُ","tj":"وَم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>رَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>كَ مَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>طَّارِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٢</span>","en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?"},{"n":3,"ar":"النَّجمُ الثّاقِبُ","tj":"ٱ<tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed><tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ثَّاقِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ُ <span class=end>٣</span>","en":"It is the piercing star -"},{"n":4,"ar":"إِن كُلُّ نَفسٍ لَمّا عَلَيها حافِظٌ","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُلُّ نَفْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>سٍ ل</tajweed>َّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ <span class=end>٤</span>","en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector."},{"n":5,"ar":"فَليَنظُرِ الإِنسٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","tj":"فَلْيَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْإِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ خُلِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>َ <span class=end>٥</span>","en":"So let man observe from what he was created."},{"n":6,"ar":"خُلِقَ مِن ماءٍ دافِقٍ","tj":"خُلِقَ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن م</tajweed>ّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ءٍ د</tajweed>َافِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ق</tajweed>ٍ <span class=end>٦</span>","en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,"},{"n":7,"ar":"يَخرُجُ مِن بَينِ الصُّلبِ وَالتَّرائِبِ","tj":"يَخْرُجُ م<tajweed class=iqlab>ِنۢ ب</tajweed>َيْنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صُّلْبِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>تَّر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِ<tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٧</span>","en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs."},{"n":8,"ar":"إِنَّهُ عَلىٰ رَجعِهِ لَقادِرٌ","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ رَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> لَقَادِرٌ <span class=end>٨</span>","en":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able."},{"n":9,"ar":"يَومَ تُبلَى السَّرائِرُ","tj":"يَوْمَ تُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِرُ <span class=end>٩</span>","en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,"},{"n":10,"ar":"فَما لَهُ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلا ناصِرٍ","tj":"فَمَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>ُوَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ و</tajweed>َلَا نَاصِرٍ <span class=end>١٠</span>","en":"Then man will have no power or any helper."},{"n":11,"ar":"وَالسَّماءِ ذاتِ الرَّجعِ","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ ذَاتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عِ <span class=end>١١</span>","en":"By the sky which returns [rain]"},{"n":12,"ar":"وَالأَرضِ ذاتِ الصَّدعِ","tj":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>عِ <span class=end>١٢</span>","en":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,"},{"n":13,"ar":"إِنَّهُ لَقَولٌ فَصلٌ","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> لَقَوْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>لٌ ف</tajweed>َصْلٌ <span class=end>١٣</span>","en":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,"},{"n":14,"ar":"وَما هُوَ بِالهَزلِ","tj":"وَمَا هُوَ بِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْهَزْلِ <span class=end>١٤</span>","en":"And it is not amusement."},{"n":15,"ar":"إِنَّهُم يَكيدونَ كَيدًا","tj":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا <span class=end>١٥</span>","en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,"},{"n":16,"ar":"وَأَكيدُ كَيدًا","tj":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا <span class=end>١٦</span>","en":"But I am planning a plan."},{"n":17,"ar":"فَمَهِّلِ الكٰفِرينَ أَمهِلهُم رُوَيدًا","tj":"فَمَهِّلِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدَۢا <span class=end>١٧</span>","en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile."}]}